<h3 id="metadataconverter">MetadataConverter</h3>
<p>This protocol exists to support unified parsing of all multimedia files. For example, mp3 and mp4 are different file formats — although they share many of the same keys, their data structures are definitely different. This requires a unified protocol: for instance, given a URL, return a model. To deal with uneven key-value layouts, this protocol was created.</p>

