  <p>Note: <strong>**The <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">AVAssetExportPresetPassthrough</code> preset does allow modifying existing metadata in <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">MPEG-4</code> and <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">QuickTime</code> containers, but it cannot add new metadata — the only way to add metadata is to use a transcoding preset. Additionally, it can’t modify <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">ID3</code> (mp3) tags. The framework doesn’t support writing MP3 data.**</strong></p>
